<https://purl.openfaster.org/sso/emptyValue> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                             rdfs:label "empty"@en .


###  https://purl.openfaster.org/sso/formulaValue
<https://purl.openfaster.org/sso/formulaValue> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                               rdfs:label "formula"@en .


###  https://purl.openfaster.org/sso/numberValue
<https://purl.openfaster.org/sso/numberValue> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ;
                                              rdfs:label "number"@en .


